# Shortly — Project Structure

**Path alias:** `@/` → `src/` (configured in `vite.config.js` + `jsconfig.json`).

## Directory Layout

```
src/
├── assets/                          # Static assets (images, fonts)
├── modules/                         # Feature modules (Vertical Slice mode)
│   ├── _core/                       #   Global shared layer (Feature-based mode)
│   │   ├── api/                     #     clients/ errors/ hooks/ utils/
│   │   ├── components/              #     atom/ base/ composite/ design/ layout/
│   │   ├── constants/ context/ hooks/ layouts/ pages/ stores/ utils/
│   │   └── index.js
│   │
│   ├── Pattern: <module>/
│   │   ├── _shared/                 #   Slice-shared (api/ constants/ contexts/ hooks/ stores/)
│   │   ├── features/<slice>/        #   One dir per use case (api/ components/ validators/)
│   │   ├── layouts/                 #   Module layout components
│   │   ├── pages/                   #   Module page components
│   │   └── index.js                 #   Public API
│   │
│   ├── auth/                        #   login/ register/ session/
│   ├── links/                       #   shortener/ management/
│   ├── brand/                       #   marketing/ (no _shared/ or layouts/)
│   └── settings/                    #   profile/ (no layouts/)
│
├── router/                          # AppRouter.jsx, ProtectedRoute.jsx
├── App.jsx
├── index.css                        # Tailwind v4 entry + DaisyUI themes
└── main.jsx
```

## Rules

- **Cross-module:** Only `_core` can be imported by other modules. All module access through root `index.js` — no deep imports.
- **Naming:** kebab-case dirs, PascalCase components (`[A|B|C|D|L]ComponentName`), camelCase hooks/utils, named exports.
- **Pages/Layouts** at module root, never inside slices or `_shared/`.
- Exceptions: `brand` has no `_shared`/`layouts`; `settings` has no `layouts`.

For detailed structure rules, load `module-architecture` skill.
